# Keep the build context small and platform-clean.
#
# node_modules must never enter the context: it contains natively-compiled
# binaries (Argon2, Prisma engines) built for the developer's OS, which would
# shadow the correct Linux ones installed inside the image.

node_modules
**/node_modules

.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.gitignore
_upload

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

data
volumes
storage
logs
*.log

README.md
SECURITY.md
